        "official_en_sha256": "7354d1a99b3838cc2544bb828176b5de3e3c2758b01acf055e4d2c9d06aef90b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ありえないことだとは思うんだけどな。\r\nただ、ウワサが無視できないくらい\r\n広まってきているのも事実なんだ。",
        "official_en": "Farfetched would be an understatement...but I do admit, the rumors are spreading too widely to ignore at this point.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
