        "official_en_sha256": "05b288d443ff184344db69c1ae428562ba13737cfb2724d3e73180d5cf8439e9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そんなものあるわけないだろ。\r\nやめてくれよ、ただでさえ今忙しいのに……",
        "official_en": "Oh, would you quit with that nonsense? I’m busy enough today already.",
        "real_en": "There's no way a train like that exists. Give it a rest. I'm busy enough as it is..."
      },
